    {
      "number": 11,
      "id": "PR_kwDOKyF5GM7cASH_",
      "title": "Add considerations for QPACK",
      "url": "https://github.com/kazuho/draft-kazuho-httpbis-http3-on-streams/pull/11",
      "state": "MERGED",
      "author": "LPardue",
      "authorAssociation": "COLLABORATOR",
      "assignees": [],
      "labels": [],
      "body": "QPACK over QMux doesn't have the same blocking considerations as\r\nQUIC, so capture that.\r\n\r\nFixes #3\r\n",
      "createdAt": "2026-05-15T17:18:45Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-18T00:27:20Z",
      "baseRepository": "kazuho/draft-kazuho-httpbis-http3-on-streams",
      "baseRefName": "main",
      "baseRefOid": "253c44c5f5f197d395523c70bf86838d768d2b3f",
      "headRepository": "kazuho/draft-kazuho-httpbis-http3-on-streams",
      "headRefName": "qpack",
      "headRefOid": "247b3262971ff4793dadf3e992701a477a66bc1d",
      "closedAt": "2026-06-18T00:27:20Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-06-18T00:27:20Z",
      "mergedBy": "LPardue",
      "mergeCommit": {
        "oid": "ee7e8a0e488601a9416d9be1e47c63b0cc7cce83"
      },
      "comments": [],
      "reviews": [
        {
          "id": "PRR_kwDOKyF5GM8AAAABAGrL2Q",
          "commit": {
            "abbreviatedOid": "8b72e38"
          },
          "author": "kazuho",
          "authorAssociation": "OWNER",
          "state": "COMMENTED",
          "body": "",
          "createdAt": "2026-05-15T23:23:46Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-05-15T23:46:04Z",
          "comments": [
            {
              "originalPosition": 8,
              "body": "```suggestion\n{{Section 4.2.1 of RFC9114}}. QPACK is designed to operate\nover QUIC version 1, which does not provide guarantees of global ordering across\n```\n\nThis is purely editorial, and I don't mind either ways.",
              "createdAt": "2026-05-15T23:23:46Z",
              "updatedAt": "2026-05-15T23:46:04Z"
            },
            {
              "originalPosition": 10,
              "body": "```suggestion\nhead-of-line blocking and optimal compression ratio ({{Section 2.1.2 of QPACK}}).\n```\n\nThe change proposed below removes the reference to Section 2.1.2 of QPACK, therefore it is moved here.",
              "createdAt": "2026-05-15T23:28:12Z",
              "updatedAt": "2026-05-15T23:46:04Z"
            },
            {
              "originalPosition": 17,
              "body": "I'm not sure about this advice.\n\nRaising SETTINGS_QPACK_BLOCKED_STREAMS increases the risk at the receiver side, because a malicious sender can intentionally send things out of order and force the receiver to buffer them. Also, it does not necessarily help the sender.\n\nI think what we want to do here is to point out that referencing dynamic table entries sent on the wire never causes the decoder to block.\n\n```suggestion\nQMux version 1 operates on top of a transport layer that guarantees\nin-order delivery and guarantees global ordering across streams. When HTTP/3\nover QMux is used, QPACK decoders will never be blocked due to packet losses.\nTo improve compression efficiency, QPACK encoders can reference a dynamic table\nentry as soon as the entry is emitted to the underlying transport, regardless of\nthe `SETTINGS_QPACK_BLOCKED_STREAMS` value advertised by the peer.\n```",
              "createdAt": "2026-05-15T23:44:26Z",
              "updatedAt": "2026-05-15T23:46:04Z"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "PRR_kwDOKyF5GM8AAAABAGzxfQ",
          "commit": {
            "abbreviatedOid": "8b72e38"
          },
          "author": "LPardue",
          "authorAssociation": "COLLABORATOR",
          "state": "COMMENTED",
          "body": "",
          "createdAt": "2026-05-16T00:07:01Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-05-16T00:07:01Z",
          "comments": [
            {
              "originalPosition": 17,
              "body": "I'll totally defer to the QPACK experts on this one. The issue was an offhand comment I tried to capture at the time, if your suggestion represents the spirit of that, SGTM.",
              "createdAt": "2026-05-16T00:07:01Z",
              "updatedAt": "2026-05-16T00:07:01Z"
            }
          ]
        }
